# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day28

## Question

How has your daily life changed compared with a few years ago?

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- What your life was like before
- What it is like now
- One major change
- Why it changed
- How you feel about the change

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> It used to be..., but now...

Also try to use:

> The main reason is...

> As a result,...

> Personally, I think...

---

## Recommended Structure

A few years ago,...

↓

It used to be...

↓

But now...

↓

The main reason is...

↓

As a result,...

↓

Personally, I think...
